window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Four gripping historical romance novels, filled with mystery, unexpected twists, steamy bedroom scenes, and breathtaking love stories.</p> <p>Experience intrigue and passion as you follow the adventures of Bathsheba, Cornelia, Estela, and Ursula.</p> <p>Travel from the wilds of the Scottish Highlands to the Mediterranean and the sensual South Seas.</p> <p>If you love heartwarming romance and unforgettable characters, then this anthology is for you.</p> <p>All four novels are self-contained.</p> <ul> <li>The Lady's Guide to Scandal</li> <li>The Lady's Guide to Well-Endowed Dukes</li> <li>The Lady's Guide to Escaping Cannibals</li> <li>The Lady's Guide to Mistletoe and Mayhem</li> </ul> <p>Brilliantly performed by British actor Gareth J Davies, and featuring sound effects.</p>"; 
